+# Async Runtime Policy
+
+This project has no recorded decision on an async runtime. A search of the repository's documentation (including `docs/`, `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and other markdown files) and its full git history turned up no ADR, RFC, policy document, or other decision record addressing an async runtime, so nothing current is documented here.
